      "writtenOn": "2016-06-18T06:58:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Though DefaultState handles CMD_RESET_SUPPLICANT_STATE, it does nothing but change state to UninitializedState, which have no ability to handle battery state changing actions, this is right for most situations, but will cause problems like https://code.google.com/p/android/issues/detail?id\u003d196120. Adding STATECMD_RESET_SUPPLICANT_STATE handler to ScanState make sure battery state will change to disconnect when WiFi has finished scanning but accessed to no WiFi net work, this is a particular situation, it needs special handle action, so I don\u0027t think it is redundant.",
